"No he pogut llegir aquest fitxer com a partida.": "I couldn't read this file as a saved game.",
"Aquest navegador no deixa desar la partida (mode privat?). Pots baixar-la a un fitxer des del menú de pausa i carregar-la aquí.": "This browser won't let the game save (private mode?). You can download it to a file from the pause menu and load it here.",
