"Les notes no es veuen a la tarota: cal tocar-les de memòria. 1 Do, 2 Re, 3 Mi, 4 Fa i 5 Sol són les cinc notes.": "The notes aren't marked on the tarota: you have to play them from memory. 1 C, 2 D, 3 E, 4 F and 5 G are the five notes.",
