"En Gori de la Caseta": "Gori from the Hut",
"La Nena de les Trenes": "The Girl with the Braids",
"Els pastors de la Cirosa": "The shepherds of the Cirosa",
"El Follet del Carro Verd": "The Imp of the Green Cart",
"La foscor tem la llum...": "Darkness fears light...",
"però més encara el riure!": "but laughter even more!",
